      "value": "Huge amounts of food and drink fill the target. It receives a full meal's worth of nourishment and must attempt a Fortitude save. A target sickened by this spell takes a \u201310-foot status penalty to its Speed until it's no longer sickened.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The target is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The target is sickened 1, but if it spends an action to end the condition, it succeeds automatically.\n- **Failure:** The target is sickened 1.\n- **Critical Failure:** The target is sickened 2."
